v3.1					version

Comments:
	Default unities: I.S.  (except indication).
	If  (Krest <> 0)  then the restoring force wouldn't be that of the Arquimedes (lithos. over liquid mantle) but this given value.
	If  (avistopoest <> 0) then the load will rest at zero level and plate subsidence will be filled with 'densinfill' material. Do not use with erosion model.
	